  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bejayawada Vinod, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 31 July, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition Nos.6204 of 2019 and 2961 of 2020 Common Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "When these matters are taken up for hearing, both the learned counsel for the petitioners in these petitions and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor would submit that these matters are squarely covered by earlier decisions of this Court, whereunder this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] the criminal proceedings initiated on similar set of facts for the similar offences against the petitioners therein on the ground that the prosecution is not maintainable under law and the Tobacco products would not fall within the definition of 'food' as defined under Section 3(j) of FSS Act.",
